 "notes": "'without relying on Lambda functions' is an absence requirement; the schema cannot assert that no resource of a type exists. Region is a provider setting. The DynamoDB grant checks bind the grant to a role: an inline role policy referencing an API Gateway-trusted role, an attachment of a granting managed policy, a role inline_policy, or a role/policy using a granting policy document; iam_table_and_indexes requires an index resource ARN (/index/). The OpenAPI-body route checks require the method as a path-item key (post: / get:), so the DynamoDB integration's httpMethod POST no longer satisfies them."
